#83000
"A Subterranean Stream"
"The cavern opens up here to a much larger dimension than would be anticipated
by the small opening to the east.  A hint of fresh air stirs the heavy air, a
welcome relief from the stale, dank environment.  A clear, cold stream crashes
into a tall step along the west side of this cavern, sinking into a crevice in
the center of the rocky floor.  The channel of the raging stream leaves the
rest of the granite floor mostly dry, with puddles here and there from the
nearby river.
"
"Dungeon, Floor 1, 53 Rooms
"
