#83002
"Slick Granite Stairs"
"Whether a set of stairs was at some point carved into the stone upon which you
stand, you cannot be certain.  Perhaps the ages had simply pulled away all
leaving only a series of waterfalls upon pure granite.  Irregardless, it
becomes very obvious that the powerful flow of the stream is tugging your feet
downward.  You'd have no choice but comply were it not for a series of holes
pocked into the walls just large enough for you to wrap a few of your fingers
in.
"
"[Altimeas] The action for this room should move the PC down with pain.
[Areradon] And it does.
"
