#83015
"Meeting Hall"
"You are standing in a large room with walls hastily plastered.  A large iron
chandelier hangs tilted from the stone above, cracks bearing relief from the
weight.  The insulating plaster of the walls is chipping and bare stone is
seen at random spots behind.  A long rectangular table sits central to the
room with chairs strewn about.  Several heads of various beasts hang mounted
along the wall against chipped wooden plaques.  An assortment of small weapons
lay in one corner.  To the east lays an entranceway using a sliding slab of
stone while to the west is a more formal wooden door.
"
"[Maurtock] should be an extra for chandelier
[Maurtock] need one for the plaques too
"
