"A Long Room"
"This room is long and narrow as though it is nothing more than a continuation
of the outside corridor.  Several large patches of colorful fabric hang as
though they are tapestries.  Random bits of straw lay nestled between corner. 
Even so the room is noticeably warmer than the rest of this dungeon.
