#83055
"Massive, Circular Chamber"
"This massive, circular chamber appears to be much better maintained than the
surrounding rooms.  The granite blocks of this chamber's walls are smooth,
almost appearing polished.  Gently leading up to a vaulted ceiling with six
evenly spaced supporting pillars, this room displays an intricate level of
architectural detail that has been long lost in the rest of the complex.
"
