"Hewn Granite Cavern"
"The western corridor ends here at a damaged stone door set in the northern
wall.  Large claw marks have been made in the floor and walls, and there also
appear to be small crater-like indentations where the floor seems to have been
dissolved in places.  There is no trace of dust or cobwebs to be found here,
though there is a faint smell of long dried blood hanging in the stale air.
"
